                    <value>&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;Important Note for &lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 14, 14); font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;Altera/PSG Users Only&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 14, 14);&quot;&gt; : As part of the Altera CRM R1 release from Jul 17-28, we are in the process of moving data and functionality to a new Altera Salesforce instance. During this time, please do not create new accounts/contacts/products/leads/opportunities/quotes/DPAs. From July 28 onwards, the new system will be available and you will receive an email with the new URL and instructions.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</value>
